    <briefdescription>
<para>Sanitizer that neutralises injection patterns in retrieved text. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Operates on scan results produced by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1security_1_1_prompt_injection_detector" kindref="compound">PromptInjectionDetector</ref> to avoid running detection twice. Can also run detection internally via the <computeroutput>sanitize(text)</computeroutput> overload.</para>
<para>Thread-safe for concurrent <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1security_1_1_prompt_injection_sanitizer_1ab0dd7d0090b3ba6486b747f3ed13d699" kindref="member">sanitize()</ref></computeroutput> calls after construction. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
